[34m##[0m[37m [0m[34mThe fix (solver settings only — no physics touched)[0m

[37m```[0m[37mxml[0m
[37m<[0m[31moption[0m[37m solver="P[0m[37mGS" jac[0m[37mobian="dense"[0m[37m tolerance="1e-12[0m[37m" iterations="100"/>[0m
